to: pastry-chef
topic: opening-menu-pastry

Use shared/menu-direction.md and shared/menu-draft.md as binding.

Develop the tasting-menu pre-dessert and plated dessert, plus all 3 a la carte
desserts. For each dish, provide a concise component specification, key
techniques, make-ahead plan, pickup sequence, allergens, and a dairy-free or
gluten-free adaptation where practical.

Preserve the light-to-rich tasting progression, keep smoke restrained, and use
live fire or preserved citrus with purpose rather than in every component.
Check that the desserts remain distinct in flavor and texture.

Write the full deliverable to shared/pastry-development.md and return it in the
handoff message to head-chef with topic opening-menu-pastry.
